WEBVTT

00:05:07.708 --> 00:05:39.324
(Muziek)

00:05:39.834 --> 00:05:40.685
Bedankt.

00:05:41.555 --> 00:05:42.346
EDI: Bedankt!

00:05:42.346 --> 00:05:43.532
(Applaus)

00:05:43.948 --> 00:05:51.803
(Muziek)

00:05:52.077 --> 00:05:54.092
MT: Dat was het. Heel erg bedankt

00:05:54.092 --> 00:05:55.385
en ook dank aan jou, EDI.

00:05:55.385 --> 00:05:56.765
EDI: Dank je, Marco.

00:05:56.781 --> 00:06:01.793
(Applaus)